Z||000000||dave@heldmotorsports.com||02-19-2001||10:26 PM||||There were a number of posts regarding Held<BR>Motorsports and Ryane Motorsports and rather<BR>than replying to each post, I thought I'd<BR>send a global message... here goes...<P>I would like to announce<BR>that Held Motorsports has acquired the manufacturing assets<BR>and exclusive rights to continue supplying Fiero and related<BR>products in Ryane Motorsport's portfolio. We began production<BR>on February 1st.<P>We will be displaying our products at the Spring Daytona show<BR>in March, Knott's Kit car show in Southern California in April<BR>and Carlisle in May... check out our web page:<P>        <A HREF="http://heldmotorsports.com" TARGET=_blank>http://heldmotorsports.com</A> <P>For those of you unfamiliar with our products, we provide brake<BR>and suspension upgrades for our favorite car. We are looking to<BR>expand into other areas and welcome your suggestions.<P>Dave Held<BR>dave@heldmotorsports.com||||reg||1
